# This repo holds ONLY the capstone secure-app code + the 4 security gates, so the
# pipeline passes on clean code. Deliverables, evidence, demo/attack scripts and
# generated artifacts stay on local disk but out of the repo (they legitimately
# contain example secrets and injection phrases that the gates would flag).

# Ignore everything at the repo root by default...
/*

# ...then re-include only the secure application and the gate configuration.
!.gitignore
!.gitleaks.toml
!.github/
!app.py
!validate.py
!output_scanner.py
!gen_token.py
!inject_scanner.py
!requirements.txt
!requirements_pinned.txt
!requirements_baseline.txt
!SECURITY_ARCHITECTURE.md
!threat_model.drawio
